OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with isolated showers through
OL,7,Fthe evening. Cloud thickening after
OL,8,Fmidnight, with further outbreaks of
OL,9,Frain likely, turning persistent in
OL,10,Fplaces and locally heavy in the west.
OL,11,FRemaining breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA cloudy and damp start for
OL,14,Fmany places. Cloud slowly breaks and
OL,15,Frain turns patchy through the morning,
OL,16,Fwith many areas dry through the
OL,17,Fafternoon. Remaining breezy and mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
