OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FVariable cloud and sunny spells on
OL,7,FThursday and Friday. Potential for
OL,8,Fmist and fog patches overnight then
OL,9,Fclearing slowly. Cloudier with rain
OL,10,FSaturday. Winds becoming light. Mild
OL,11,Fby day.
